{
	"name": "Quadrille",
	"short_name": "Quadrille",
	"description": "A pattern toy that builds interlaced op art bands from one element, a striped quarter disc in the corner of a square: stack the discs in each cell and their stripes join into arches, S-bends, chains and braids. Tap a cell to change it, try the presets taken from hand-drawn sketches, randomise, explore variations and save SVG or PNG",
